  "unit_verified_mechanisms": [
    "Rust selected indices are bounded; immutable option identities and per-popup tokens reject superseded, dismissed, duplicate, disabled and out-of-range commands.",
    "Empty/disabled controls cannot open or change state. Programmatic changes cancel pending menu identity. Menu admission and prefix changes distinguish same-value callbacks.",
    "Prefix search extends within one second from the selected row, restarts after timeout at the next row, wraps matching and resets on clock rollback; disabled, empty and control input does not poison the search.",
